# Local testing only until publish is requested

Until the user explicitly says to publish/deploy (e.g. "pubblica", "aggiorna il sito", "push"), work is local testing only.

- Update the project files as requested.
- Do not `git push`, do not deploy GitHub Pages, do not publish `gh-pages`, do not upload the site.
- The public site at https://sisoseller.github.io/soldatox/ staying on older files is expected.
- Commit only if the user asks. Push/deploy only when they clearly ask to publish.
